[17.913, "o", "The Placement `demo-all` in `default` currently selects **cluster1, cluster2, and cluster3** (its PlacementDecision `demo-all-decision-1`, 3 clusters in one decision group).\r\n\r\nWhy those: its spec is essentially unrestricted — it targets the `global` cluster set (`spec.clusterSets: [global]`), which contains every managed cluster in the fleet, and it defines no predicates, `numberOfClusters` limit, tolerations, or spread constraints. So every cluster in that set is eligible and selected, sorted by cluster name. Status confirms it's healthy: `PlacementMisconfigured=False` and `PlacementSatisfied=True` (\"All cluster decisions scheduled\").\r\n"]
[0.349, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
[3.025, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m# 6. ship a new service the LAZY way - the guardrails must refuse\u001b[0m\r\n"]
